turally, slow pan/slider. Model breathes visibly, gently shifts posture, NO mannequin stillness, background clean.\n- 0.5–4.125s: Collar — Macro push-in; model breathes gently, neck/shoulder muscles “alive”, no face; camera moves, NEVER static.\n- …（其余分镜同上逻辑）\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 66, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 302, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [504.3258361816406, 728.2025146484375], "pos": [379.1332702636719, 2211.13427734375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 118, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 357, "type": "JjkShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkShowText"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 588.9091186523438], "pos": [1405.80078125, 2411.6787109375], "widgets_values": ["video/ComfyUI", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 124, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "编码器"}], "flags": {}, "id": 360, "type": "SaveVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideo"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 588.9091186523438], "pos": [864.7098999023438, 2621.381103515625], "wi